      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be a great feature! As someone who is a part of a bunch of different social groups on VRChat, instance hosts constantly have to remind people to wait a bit before entering the portal to a game world, or to a hang out world with a video player. This feature would eliminate that so there's no conflict on who the instance master is.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
