      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "NEEDED!!!! I host the VR meets for my group and it’s annoying having to tell everyone to wait for 10-15 seconds every time. But having to redo the instance is more annoying. This is such a needed feature!",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
